# Apps that ./project up runs from source (one key per line; # starts a comment).
# Copied to ./services on the first `./project up` (gitignored): edit that copy, not this file.
# Infrastructure (Postgres, Redis, RabbitMQ, Traefik), the deps job and the <svc>-migrate jobs start
# on their own; an app that is not listed does not run (requests that need it answer 502/503).
#
# The full stack needs about 10-12 GB of RAM for Docker Desktop. On a smaller machine keep only:
#   gateway auth content assessment fe
gateway
auth
admin
content
assessment
study-room
vocabulary
document
ai-chat
